      "message": "[warning] Line 1046: 🟡 On an answer, `mediaIndex` is the compressed index of enabled local media, but `hasAnyExactRtcpFeedback` indexes the original remote SDP array directly. A rejected/inactive remote m-line before the video m-line makes this lookup inspect the wrong media (although `remoteMedia` above correctly uses `findEnabledMedia`), so generic NACK can be omitted or taken from another m-line. Resolve the same enabled remote media before checking feedback and add a disabled-m-line regression test.",
