      "message": "[warning] Line 1051: 🟡 `hasAnyExactRtcpFeedback` returns one boolean for all payloads, then this emits `* nack` in an answer. If the offer permits generic NACK for only one of several video payload types, the answer overstates support for every payload in the m-line. Preserve the matching payload type(s), using `*` only when the feedback is valid for all negotiated formats, and cover a mixed-codec offer.",
      "revId": "75881acfa12b1dd08e9b3bb0a6a8714466c3ca23",
